# Written by browser verification runs — screenshots and traces, not sources.
# `.playwright-mcp` is the one this repo actually produces today: the Playwright
# MCP server drops its captures there. The rest only appear if a Playwright test
# runner is ever installed here, and cost nothing to ignore in advance.
.playwright-mcp
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
